{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2021-06-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'EQT STRENGTHENS COMMITMENT TO REDUCING METHANE EMISSIONS, JOINS OGMP 2.0 INITIATIVE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, JUNE 23, 2021 \xa0/PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQT CORPORATION (NYSE: EQT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENHANCED ITS COMMITMENT AND LEADERSHIP IN REDUCING METHANE EMISSIONS BY JOINING THE OIL & GAS METHANE PARTNERSHIP 2.0 INITIATIVE. "REDUCING METHANE EMISSIONS IS A FOUNDATIONAL COMPONENT OF OUR MISSION TO BE THE OPERATOR OF CHOICE FOR ALL OF OUR STAKEHOLDERS, A RESPONSIBILITY WE EMBRACE AS THE COUNTRY\'S LARGEST PRODUCER OF NATURAL GAS," SAID TOBY Z.'}